wardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>VIETNAM</span> <span>08/08/2019</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix X570-E Gaming Media review Award of Editor's Choice\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://techguru.vn/tren-tay-bo-mach-chu-asus-rog-strix-x570-e-gaming/?fbclid=IwAR0EfiKFDujUgU8JDXzg-yzBN-7a3ahIBuFLr4oNYCNwIfvwvV-_c7p9CEU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202001282117152670843.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Gold Award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      hardware-helden.de\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Gold Award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Gold Award\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>01/27/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix X570-E Gaming Media review Award of Gold Award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://hardware-helden.de/test-asus-rog-strix-e-motherboard/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202003202050097590384.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Buy recommendation\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      gamezoom.net\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Buy recommendation</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The new ASUS ROG Strix X570-E Gaming is the perfect base for Ryzen 3000s users who want high performance and features\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>07/07/2019</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix X570-E Gaming Media review Award of Buy recommendation\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.gamezoom.net/artikel/ASUS_ROG_Strix_X570_E_Gaming_Test_Review-43684-14\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1312/202001102126564770077.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Recommended\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Guru3d\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Recommended</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Yep, she's purty and agile, the new STRIX X570-E Gaming delivers on most fronts.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>NETHERLANDS</span> <span>09/23/2019</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix X570-E Gaming Media review Award of Recommended\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.guru3d.com/articles-pages/asus-strix-x570-e-gaming-review.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1323/201911201559020370451.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Back2Gaming Silver Award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Back2Gaming\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Back2Gaming Silver Award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      If you're looking to get a quality X570 boards from ASUS and is looking for a more work/play mix but don't want to spend more for an ROG Hero class board, the ASUS ROG Strix X570-E is a great option and easily delivers the best for most systems.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>PHILIPPINES</span> <span>10/31/2019</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix X570-E Gaming Media review Award of Back2Gaming Silver Award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.back2gaming.com/reviews/b2g-hardware/hw-components/cpu-mobo/asus-rog-strix-x570-e-gaming-motherboard-review/10/#split_content\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1276/201911232235501620817.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"8 out of 10\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Medcom\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>8 out of 10</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Soal konektivitas, ASUS ROG Strix X570-E Gaming sudah siap menyambut koneksi WiFi 6 yang memiliki kecepatan lebih kencang lagi. Koneksi WiFi maupun LAN di motherboard ini sudah mendkung frekuensi dual-band. Motherboard ini dibanderol mulai dari Rp6 juta.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>INDONESIA</span> <span>09/16/2019</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix X570-E Gaming Media review Award of 8 out of 10\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.medcom.id/teknologi/review/9K5rym3N-menjajal-duet-asus-rog-strix-x570-e-gaming-dan-ryzen-7-3700x\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1281/202003130522318160686.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Gold by XtremeHardware\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      XtremeHardware\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Gold by XtremeHardware</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      If you are looking for an excellent motherboard for the new Ryzen CPUs ,this motherboard is definitely a great choice.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>ITALY</span> <span>08/25/2019</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Strix X570-E Gaming Media review Award of Gold by XtremeHardware\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.xtremehardware.com/recensioni/schede-madri/recensione-asus-rog-crosshair-viii-formula-strix-x570-e-gaming-bios-overclock-test-2-2019082512819/?start=2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1281/202003130513201580078.png\" alt=\"\" ari